==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[behaviourism]] {{label|en|British spelling}}

===Etymology===
{{suffix|behavior|ism|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|American spelling}} An approach to [[psychology]] focusing on [[observable]] [[behavior]], denying any [[independent]] [[significance]] for [[mind]], and usually assuming that behavior is determined by the [[environment]].

====Synonyms====
* [[behavioral psychology]]

====Hyponyms====
* [[Skinnerism]]

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|behaviorist}}
* {{l|en|behavioristic}}

